{"availability":"AVAILABLE","episodes":[{"airDate":"2024-10-03","number":1,"rating":null,"runtimeMinutes":24,"source":"tmdb","still":{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OSKgDK6nAF8NeUV1mLdhj3jDf4.jpg"},"synopsis":"Storybook author Hotaru is depressed, unable to focus on work after losing his beloved dog, Hanako. A strange creature shows up in his yard that looks like a mushroom but also a dog. Komako, his childhood friend and editor, is baffled by the situation.","title":"Kinokoinu Is Born"},{"airDate":"2024-10-10","number":2,"rating":null,"runtimeMinutes":24,"source":"tmdb","still":{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evAy4kZyBauq8JhjX4sAkmDM4s5.jpg"},"synopsis":"Itsuki is a superfan of Hotaru and falls in love with him at first sight. Hotaru is tricked by Komako to accepting an interview and photoshoot for a dog magazine. Hotaru is struck with an intense realization after taking Kinokoinu on a walk.","title":"Kinokoinu and Hanako"},{"airDate":"2024-10-17","number":3,"rating":null,"runtimeMinutes":24,"source":"tmdb","still":{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojd2iVWPQJkmIjjZC4yUHCyemOn.jpg"},"synopsis":"\"Hotaru gets frustrated at Kinokoinu for disrupting his work. Kinokoinu gets upset and runs away after Hotaru compares it to Hanako.\"","title":"Where Are You Going, Oh, Kinokoinu?"},{"airDate":"2024-10-24","number":4,"rating":null,"runtimeMinutes":24,"source":"tmdb","still":{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QttSTN9ALTEBae42YmM1l484wK.jpg"},"synopsis":"\"Hotaru catches Kinokoinu releasing spores in the morning. Komako hosts a Halloween takoyaki party for Kinokoinu. Kinokoinu releases white spores after the party at night, which is a spectacular sight.\"","title":"Kinokoinu, It's Time to Party"},{"airDate":"2024-10-31","number":5,"rating":null,"runtimeMinutes":24,"source":"tmdb","still":{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FTL9wfJznP7iUbWSdzmgt0wT9E.jpg"},"synopsis